# Axiom footprints of the roots (ROOTS.txt) and of the test theorems (namespace EraseProof.Test).
# One line per declaration: <declaration> <axioms>
#   <axioms>: its `#print axioms`, comma-separated in the order propext, Classical.choice,
#             Quot.sound; `-` for none. sorryAx and Cardinal.exists_inaccessibles never occur.
EraseProof.TypeEq.forallE_ne_ind propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound
EraseProof.TypeEq.forallE_ne_quot propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound
EraseProof.TypeEq.ind_ne_quot propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound
EraseProof.TypeEq.sort_ne_forallE propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound
EraseProof.TypeEq.sort_ne_ind propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound
EraseProof.TypeEq.sort_ne_quot propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound
